# Forward-metric ledgers exceed GitHub's per-file limit on the larger
# partitions. They are regenerable from the committed code SHA and the hashed
# source archive; byte hashes for every ledger, including these, are recorded
# in outputs/stage_02/LEDGER_HASHES.csv.
outputs/stage_02/detailed/forward_metrics_*.csv.gz

# Processed market data derived from the paid 1s dataset. AGENTS.md restricts
# git to code, documentation, manifests and synthetic tests.
# The expanded histogram directory stays out of git; the compressed archive in
# outputs/stage_06_cache/ is committed instead and rehydrates it. This
# environment rolls the workspace back between turns, and an uncommitted cache
# costs a seven-minute rebuild every time.
outputs/stage_06_histograms/
